// Flattened wizard.rs2's [ai_queue3,wizard] table. npc_param(death_drop)
// is unset (null) on this NPC's config, so no guaranteed drop.
// map_members is always true, so the bloodrune branch is used (not the
// f2p mind_talisman fallback). Slots 112-127 (16/128) match no branch: no
// additional drop.
